  <diagram name="Rules" id="wtl9ojlTd3QihocVHBSX">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2074" dy="2041" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1169" pageHeight="827" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="MLjKId_jfAtGnYWAh8Pz-0" />
        <mxCell id="MLjKId_jfAtGnYWAh8Pz-1" value="Background" style="" parent="MLjKId_jfAtGnYWAh8Pz-0" />
        <mxCell id="MLjKId_jfAtGnYWAh8Pz-14" value="Main Layer" style="" parent="MLjKId_jfAtGnYWAh8Pz-0" />
        <mxCell id="MLjKId_jfAtGnYWAh8Pz-30" value="&lt;h1&gt;Rules&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Every process has a start point and an end point which are not other BPs&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Two BPs may not have the same start and end point: this would mean they are the same BP but with multiple routes inside&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- No Step/Box without an APN number: remove the interface boxes that are not needed (i.e AME, AMS, eTL...)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- One APN per box (more may be possible if the same action can be done in multiple APNs)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Other BPs have to be detailed using their number and name&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Each Decision Point can be associated with a description if adds value&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- No Swim lanes for departments, they should be identified by colour coding with a legend at the bottom - No other colour coding is allowed&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Interfaces &quot;in&quot; and &quot;out&quot; data flow shall be represented with arrows point towards the &quot;cloud&quot; or towards the action.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- The BP needs to fit on an A4 or A3&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="MLjKId_jfAtGnYWAh8Pz-14">
